OL,3,GNEWSASolutions sniffed out for bad
OL,4,Asmell plaguing city
OL,5,
OL,6,FA water firm said it is making progress
OL,7,Fto tackle bad smells from a sewage
OL,8,Ftreatment site that have upset
OL,9,Fneighbouring households for years.
OL,11,FAnglian Water is investigating
OL,12,Fdifferent ways it can stop what has
OL,13,Fbeen dubbed the "Whitlingham whiff" by
OL,14,Flocals living in Norwich. It hopes to
OL,15,Fcreate a chemical curtain to block the
OL,16,Fstink and a storage barn for solid
OL,17,Fsewage chunks as part of the measures.
OL,19,FStrong odours emanating from the sewage
OL,20,Ftreatment works on the city outskirts
OL,21,Fhave particularly affected people
OL,22,Fliving in Thorpe St Andrew.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,377,370,200,160,0,100
